<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104301" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοξ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for the bow,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. θῶμιγξ, ἄτρακτος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				460
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				139
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. στολή</span> an
			<i>archer's</i> equipment, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				833b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. κάλαμος</span> a kind of
			Cretan reed used for arrows, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.11.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοξική</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i>archery,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				197a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>La.</u>
				193b
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1060.5
			</span></i> (Tralles, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -κόν</span>”
				<i>shot-hole, loophole,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Jd.</u>
					5.28
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Ez.</u>
				40.16
			</span></i>: so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυρίς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				81.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>skilled in the use of the bow,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάνδαρος</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.405b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοξικώτατοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.2.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -κόν,</span> collectively, <i>the
				bowmen,</i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τοξόται,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				462
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				36.47
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηλίκα τοξικὰ ἔχουσι;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Mim.Oxy.</u>
					413.198
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. φάρμακον</span> poison <i>for smearing
				arrows with,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				837a13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				21 ii 14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				126
			</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					3.4.18
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.106
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				9.15
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.79
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			=
			<i>venenum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
